title: "pov-recovery: allow retrying descendants after parent recovery fails"
doc:
  - audience: [Node Dev, Node Operator]
    description: |
      Clear the recovery flags of deferred descendants when their parent's recovery
      is abandoned. This allows subsequent recovery requests to schedule those
      blocks again instead of leaving them stuck waiting for discarded data.
      No API changes or migration are required.
crates:
  - name: cumulus-client-pov-recovery
    bump: patch
